---

---

<main class="wedding-home">
	<div class="content">
		<h1>Inma + Romain</h1>

		<p>Preparamos algo especial...</p>
		<p><em>Nous préparons quelque chose de spécial...</em></p>
		<p class="hourglass">⏳</p>

		<p class="soon">La web llega pronto - <em>Le site arrive bientôt</em></p>
	</div>
</main>

<style>
	.wedding-home {
		min-height: 100vh;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		text-align: center;
		font-family: "Berkshire Swash", cursive;
		color: #ff6f24;
	}

	.content {
		width: 75%;
	}

	.hourglass {
		display: inline-block;
		animation: hourglass 4s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	@keyframes hourglass {
		0% {
			transform: rotate(0deg);
		}

		15% {
			transform: rotate(180deg);
		}

		100% {
			transform: rotate(180deg);
		}
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
		margin: 0 0 2rem;
	}

	p {
		font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
	}

	.soon {
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
	}
</style>
